menu "NIDD probe sample"

config NIDD_PROBE_APN
  string "APN of the carrier's Non-IP service"
  default "VZWSCEF"
  help
    Verizon's SCEF APN. Frames sent on it reach the account's NiddService
    callback, and the account's downlinks arrive on it.

config NIDD_PROBE_DEDICATED_CID
  bool "Carry the Non-IP PDN on a context of its own"
  help
    Off, the default context becomes the Non-IP PDN and the board has no IP
    at all, which is all a NIDD-only plan allows. On, the default context
    keeps its IP PDN beside it, which needs a plan that carries IP data too.

config NIDD_PROBE_CLAIM_KEY
  string "Claim key, 32 hex digits"
  help
    The pigeon's 16-byte claim key: the HELLO frame carries it, and every
    platform frame's tag is keyed with it. Set it in the git-ignored
    prj.local.conf, never here.

module = NIDD_PROBE
module-str = NIDD probe sample
source "$(ZEPHYR_BASE)/subsys/logging/Kconfig.template.log_config"

endmenu

menu "Zephyr Kernel"
source "Kconfig.zephyr"
endmenu
